'''Nibbler Chaser''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to kill [[TzKal-Zuk]] without casting any spells in the [[Inferno]].

==Strategy==
[[Blood Barrage]] can no longer be used as a means to restore health, so alternate means of healing include the [[Saradomin godsword]] (also restores prayer), [[ancient godsword]] (less efficient) or [[toxic blowpipe]].

[[Chinchompa (weapon)|Chinchompas]] or a [[venator bow]] will be needed to kill the [[Jal-Nib]]s.

While the achievement's description states that all spells cannot be used, there are some exceptions. For example, summoning [[thrall]]s and [[Death Charge]] will '''not''' cause the achievement to be failed. Similarly, the [[eldritch Nightmare staff]] '''special attack''' does not fail the task despite it being a targeted attack and calculating damage based on magic level and magic strength. 

